---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Architecture"
  description="Engineering and security deep-dive for AI Job Agent — process topology, privacy boundaries, and safety controls."
>
  <main class="bg-grid">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-paper-50">
        Architecture
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-paper-300">
        A full engineering deep-dive — process topology, IPC contracts,
        privacy boundaries, and the state machine behind human-controlled
        submission — is in progress.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-paper-300">
        In the meantime, the safety architecture summary lives on the{" "}
        <a
          href="/projects/ai-job-agent"
          class="text-cyan-400 underline underline-offset-2"
        >AI Job Agent case study</a>, and the full source is on{" "}
        <a
          href="https://github.com/pushpendra-devera/ai-job-agent"
          class="text-cyan-400 underline underline-offset-2"
        >GitHub</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
